  "expectation": "Fails for an <svg> with an explicit image role (img, graphics-document, graphics-symbol)\nand no name. Without a role the graphic may be decoration next to text: review. Names from <title>\nor aria-label pass, decorative SVGs pass, and an icon in a named button passes. Hidden subtrees are\nout of scope.",
